                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just saw this game on the steam page, and jumped on it because of the price. \nI own and have played BAM, Onward , Pavlov and from a single player perspective, this game is on it's way to be the next BAM.\n\nLove the gun action and the controls. Locomation is pretty good, and there are a good variety of maps.\n\nThe tutorial is very well done, simple and the animations  made it very easy to grasp.\n\nI only play single player, so multi player fans, please check out the other reviews.\n\nThe bots are pretty good , just played for 40 min bots only, and had a blast.\nI have seen the bots shoot out of cover, and duck into rooms when under fire.\n\nThanks Devs! I only bought this because the store description said \"bots\" and I am having a lot of fun.\n\nNote: There is currently no single player only mode, you host a game and can start it with just bots by pressing both the triggers. Mid game people can drop in and replace bots. Dev's mentioned that they are working on a single player only mode.",
